Okay... I made my decision.\nOr rather, I didn't think there was any other choice here.%K%P
好…决定了。\n应该说，感觉这次没有别的选择了。%K%P
She constantly helped and supported me in every possible\nway ever since I got hurt.%K%P
从我受伤之后，她几乎是每天从头到脚照顾我。%K%P
And I was sure she would have found a new place to live by\nChristmas.%K%P
而且，在圣诞节这个时间点，\n麻实也要搬进新家，开始新的生活了。%K%P
It was the perfect opportunity to celebrate this fresh new\nstart in her life.%K%P
或许是一个祝福她开始新生活的理想方案。%K%P
